WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:08.527
Cozlin looked at all the cameras.

2
00:00:08.528 --> 00:00:11.430
"Cool! I'm going to be on TV!"

3
00:00:11.431 --> 00:00:14.575
The show's host, Tark Zeldo, walked over.

4
00:00:14.576 --> 00:00:17.173
"Kid Comet! I'm glad you're here.

5
00:00:17.174 --> 00:00:20.864
We'll have a wonderful interview."

6
00:00:20.865 --> 00:00:23.970
Cozlin and Tark sat down.

7
00:00:23.971 --> 00:00:25.797
Tark looked at a camera.

8
00:00:25.798 --> 00:00:30.841
"Good morning, Delkor! Kid Comet is with me to talk about her life as a superhero.

9
00:00:30.842 --> 00:00:34.614
So, Kid Comet, what's it like being so powerful?"

10
00:00:34.615 --> 00:00:39.291
Cozlin shrugged. "It's not a big deal—to me, at least.

11
00:00:39.292 --> 00:00:42.390
I've been powerful for my entire life!"

12
00:00:42.391 --> 00:00:47.580
"You have a pretty big job, keeping us safe all by yourself," Tark said.

13
00:00:47.581 --> 00:00:50.732
"Do you ever wish Delkor had more superheroes?"

14
00:00:50.733 --> 00:00:55.015
Cozlin snorted. "I don't need help."

15
00:00:55.016 --> 00:00:57.485
Tark's device beeped.

16
00:00:57.486 --> 00:01:02.780
"Oh! I'm getting some breaking news . . . A big robot's invading our city!"

17
00:01:02.781 --> 00:01:06.787
Cozlin waved a hand. "I'll be right back, Tark!"

18
00:01:06.788 --> 00:01:12.058
Zoom! Cozlin was gone in a flash.

19
00:01:12.059 --> 00:01:17.211
Downtown, she saw Delkorians running all over.

20
00:01:17.212 --> 00:01:23.836
Smoke rose from an intersection, and a big robot crushed a bus. Crunch!

21
00:01:23.837 --> 00:01:31.129
Zap! Lasers shot from Cozlin's hand, destroying the robot. Ka-boom!

22
00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:36.343
Cozlin laughed. "What a junky—"

23
00:01:36.344 --> 00:01:39.711
Another robot threw a car at her.

24
00:01:39.712 --> 00:01:43.880
Zap! Cozlin blasted that robot.

25
00:01:43.881 --> 00:01:48.161
But then another robot appeared and smashed a police car.

26
00:01:48.162 --> 00:01:52.837
"Kid Comet!" a voice cried. It was Detective Borzon.

27
00:01:52.838 --> 00:01:56.416
He was hiding behind a tree with several other Delkorians.

28
00:01:56.417 --> 00:01:58.744
Cozlin hurried over.

29
00:01:58.745 --> 00:02:04.611
"Is that your car, Detective? It looks great! I like all the dents."

30
00:02:04.612 --> 00:02:10.706
The detective frowned. "Ha-ha. This is serious, Kid Comet."

31
00:02:10.707 --> 00:02:16.430
Cozlin shrugged. "I know it seems serious, Detective. But I can handle it."

32
00:02:16.431 --> 00:02:20.405
She scratched her head. "I'm confused though.

33
00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:25.605
Tark Zeldo said there was one robot. I've seen three." "At

34
00:02:25.606 --> 00:02:29.375
first there was one," someone said. "But—" "Look!"

35
00:02:29.376 --> 00:02:32.366
Detective Borzon pointed. Cozlin

36
00:02:32.367 --> 00:02:36.777
spun around. One of the robots ate a car. Strange

37
00:02:36.778 --> 00:02:39.443
sounds came from inside the robot. Then

38
00:02:39.444 --> 00:02:42.615
a hatch popped open on the back of the robot. A

39
00:02:42.616 --> 00:02:46.995
new robot popped out! Down

40
00:02:46.996 --> 00:02:53.152
the street she saw another robot eat a car and make a new robot. Cozlin

41
00:02:53.153 --> 00:02:55.299
flew high into the air. She

42
00:02:55.300 --> 00:03:07.173
looked down and gasped. Robots were everywhere! ***

43
00:03:07.174 --> 00:03:09.918
"I'm mad!" Roxy said.

44
00:03:09.919 --> 00:03:14.422
Roxy and her friends were walking home from school, talking about their day.

45
00:03:14.423 --> 00:03:19.141
During recess an older kid had made fun of Terrell for wearing glasses.

46
00:03:19.142 --> 00:03:24.308
"I was mad too," Mara said. "But at least he apologized."

47
00:03:24.309 --> 00:03:27.687
"He seemed pretty sorry," Jack said.

48
00:03:27.688 --> 00:03:33.025
Roxy frowned. "He only apologized because he got in trouble.

49
00:03:33.026 --> 00:03:35.851
A teacher had to talk to him first."

50
00:03:35.852 --> 00:03:40.747
Terrell shrugged. "It's not a big deal, Roxy."

51
00:03:40.748 --> 00:03:44.501
Jack and Mara turned left to go to their homes.

52
00:03:44.502 --> 00:03:47.170
Roxy and Terrell walked together.

53
00:03:47.171 --> 00:03:50.863
"I don't think you should forgive the kid, Terrell," Roxy said.

54
00:03:50.864 --> 00:03:54.997
"When people are bad, they're always bad."

55
00:03:54.998 --> 00:03:58.838
"That sounds kind of harsh," Terrell said.

56
00:03:58.839 --> 00:04:02.033
"Remember Dr. Odd, the robot maker?"

57
00:04:02.034 --> 00:04:04.159
Terrell nodded.

58
00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:09.184
"He was just released from prison for good behavior," Roxy said.

59
00:04:09.185 --> 00:04:13.765
"But there's no way he's a good guy now."

60
00:04:13.766 --> 00:04:17.453
"Maybe he changed," Terrell said.

61
00:04:17.454 --> 00:04:19.861
"No way," Roxy repeated.

62
00:04:19.862 --> 00:04:26.098
"It's only a matter of time before he commits more crimes."

63
00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:34.289
Just then Roxy's watch beeped. "Mayor Bloom! What's wrong?"

64
00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:36.196
The mayor looked scared.

65
00:04:36.197 --> 00:04:45.845
"We need help, Rocket Girl! There's a huge monster in downtown Metro City!"

